''la goran. topitc.''

Formerly active (('Tweeners|'Tweener)), last sighted in late 1999 (http://groups.yahoo.com/group/lojban/message/1085). Croatian, fearsomely fluent. ((The Glasgow Conversation|The Lojban conversation)) held between ((Nick Nicholas)) and Goran in Glasgow in 1995 is arguably the stuff of ((Lojbanic Mythology)).

